====================================================
Species:
X, Y, A, B

ODE Model:
====================================================

dx/dt = k1 * X^2 * Y^3 - k2 * A^3 * B^2
dy/dt = k2 * A^3 * B^2 - k3 * X^2 * Y^3
da/dt = -k5 * A^a * B^b
db/dt = k6 * A^a * B^b

====================================================
Coefficients:
====================================================

k1 = 1.0
k2 = 0.5
k3 = 0.1
k4 = 0.05
k5 = 0.01
k6 = 0.001
a = 5.0
b = 3.0
